    4.8,
    ARRAY['Prawns cook in under 4 minutes; overcooking makes them rubbery.', 'Tamarind provides the quintessential Goan sour counter-balance to coconut milk.'],
    '{"calories":330,"protein":"28g","carbs":"9g","fat":"20g"}'::jsonb
